      "value": "I'm not sure if you can edit the post title, but if you can, you should.\n\n\"Public avatars\"\n\nPersonally I have a few avatars marked public and I do not want them listed on my profile. I would submit them to a search system if VRChat were to make thier own avatar search system.",
